                "text": "<h2>Jewelry Tarnish—How Long Can Plated Jewelry Last?</h2><p>The service life of plated jewelry depends on the base material, surface preparation, plating specification, protective finishing and everyday wear. For projects that need additional surface protection, e-coating or nano protective finishes can be considered as part of the finishing system.</p>",
